# Proft, Sinister Mastermind: the threshold counts YOUR graveyard (CR 601.3), and the discard ability has no threshold.
# On turn 2 Bot2 casts two Town Greeters with Moxen and a Forest, milling seven cards into ITS graveyard. On turn 3 Bot1
# has an empty graveyard and {B}{B}{B} floating (a Dark Ritual): Proft is refused although the mana is there and Bot2
# has seven cards in its own graveyard. With the same card and the same mana, "{B}, Discard this card: Target creature
# gets -3/-1" is allowed: it kills Bot2's 1/1 Town Greeter, and Proft is in Bot1's graveyard afterwards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
